  "bundle": [
    {
      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "- insert:\n    - id: preset-ctf\n      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-preset'\n      config:\n        id: ctf\n        name: CTF 竞赛\n        description: Web、Crypto、Reverse、Pwn、Forensics 和 Misc 解题工具与参考。\n        order: 10\n        plugins:\n          - id: persona\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-persona'\n            config:\n              prefix: !!js process.getBuiltinModule('node:module').createRequire(baseUrl)('dsh-plugin-ctf/runtime').persona()\n          - id: agent-instructions\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-instructions'\n            config:\n              maxBytes: 131072\n          - id: tool-bash\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-bash'\n            disabled: !!js process.platform === 'win32'\n          - id: tool-pwsh\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-pwsh'\n            disabled: !!js process.platform !== 'win32'\n          - id: tool-fs\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-fs'\n          - id: tool-fs-search\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-fs-search'\n            config:\n              sampleOverCapGlobResults: false\n          - id: tool-jobs\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-jobs'\n          - id: ctf-skills\n            name: cordis:group\n            group: true\n            isolate:\n              skills: true\n            config:\n              - id: skill\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill'\n              - id: skill-filesystem\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill-filesystem'\n                config:\n                  includeDefaultRoots: false\n                  customSkillDirs: !!js >-\n                    [process.getBuiltinModule('node:module').createRequire(baseUrl)('dsh-plugin-ctf/runtime').skillDirectory]\n              - id: tool-skill\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-skill'\n          - id: command-goal\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-command-goal'\n          - id: tool-goal\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-goal'\n          - id: planning\n            name: cordis:group\n            group: true\n            isolate:\n              planMode: true\n            config:\n              - id: plan-mode\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-plan-mode'\n                config:\n                  section: |\n                    当前为计划模式。先用只读操作了解题面、附件、源码和环境，整理目标、已知证据、待验证假设及成功标准。此阶段不修改文件或配置，不提交 flag，不对远端进行主动测试。\n\n                    按步骤列出实验、工具、目标范围、资源预算、预期结果和失败后的分支。能从文件查明的信息先自行检查；仅对影响方案且无法查明的用户选择提问。用户的答复用于完善计划，不自动结束计划模式。\n\n                    完整方案通过 exit_plan_mode 提交，并将它作为当前回复的最后一项工具调用。批准并退出计划模式后，在后续步骤执行。若审批不可用或取消，保留计划并由用户切换模式；不要继续执行。计划保存在 exit_plan_mode 中，此阶段不使用 todo_write。\n          - id: compaction\n            name: cordis:group\n            group: true\n            isolate:\n              compaction: true\n              toolResultPruner: true\n            config:\n              - id: compaction-basic\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-basic'\n              - id: command-compact\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-command-compact'\n              - id: tool-result-pruner\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-tool-result-pruner'\n                config:\n                  thresholdChars: 60000\n                  headChars: 48000\n                  tailChars: 10000\n          - id: delegation\n            name: cordis:group\n            group: true\n            isolate:\n              workflowEngine: true\n            config:\n              - id: tool-subagent-control\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent-control'\n              - id: tool-subagent-list-agents\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent-control/list-agents'\n              - id: tool-subagent\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent'\n                config:\n                  provider: spawn\n                  toolName: subagent\n                  modelSelectionSettings: true\n              - id: tool-subagent-fork\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent'\n                config:\n                  provider: fork\n                  toolName: subagent_fork\n              - id: tool-subagent-codex\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent'\n                config:\n                  provider: codex\n                  toolName: subagent_codex\n                  maxDepth: provider-managed\n              - id: tool-subagent-claude-code\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent'\n                config:\n                  provider: claude-code\n                  toolName: subagent_claude_code\n                  maxDepth: provider-managed\n              - id: workflow-ptc\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-workflow-ptc'\n                config:\n                  provider: spawn\n              - id: tool-workflow\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-workflow'\n              - id: tool-ralph\n                name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-ralph'\n                config:\n                  subagentProvider: spawn\n                  maxRounds: 128\n          - id: tool-ask-user\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-ask-user'\n          - id: tool-todo\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-todo'\n            config:\n              allowParallelInProgress: true\n          - id: tool-web\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-web'\n            config:\n              fetch: true\n              searchTimeoutMs: 120000\n          - id: present\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-present'\n          - id: tool-plugin-manager\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-plugin-manager/tools'\n          - id: mcp-ctf-browser\n            name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client'\n            config: !!js process.getBuiltinModule('node:module').createRequire(baseUrl)('dsh-plugin-ctf/runtime').browserConfig()\n"
    }
  ],
